@kind ambient
@topic veteran
@who *
@levels 40-50
tip for new folks: train your skills every level, it adds up
dont rush, the 20s are where you learn your class
consider before you pull, it saves a lot of deaths
camp bonus is real, find a quiet spot and stay
group when you can, solo when you must
keep a few potions handy, thank me later
spec for what you enjoy, not what the forums say
your bind point is a lifesaver, set it near your camp
a good healer is worth more than any drop
if a group wipes, laugh, regroup, try again
the frontier is a different game, go when you are ready
crafters are your friends, be nice to them

